 * Parse INI text into its settings.
 * @param {string} text - the file's whole text.
 * @returns {Map<string, {text: string, line: number, column: number}>} each dotted key's raw
 *   value and the position, in the file, of that value's text, in the order the file writes them.
 * @throws {IniError} on the first line the grammar refuses.
 */
